{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Félix Yogue": 16,
    "Player": 5
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7051501",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Félix Yogue",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705150101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705150101": {
            "id": "705150101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Ah, bravo! All six Evermotion Mechanical Painting parts, now returned to us! Now then, all we need to do is to splice them together again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150102"
            ]
          },
          "705150102": {
            "id": "705150102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "All... of them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150103"
            ]
          },
          "705150103": {
            "id": "705150103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Why, of course! All these six smaller parts can be reunited as one!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150104"
            ]
          },
          "705150104": {
            "id": "705150104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Together, they will form a gigantic and beauteous Evermotion Mechanical Painting.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150105"
            ]
          },
          "705150105": {
            "id": "705150105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Come, come, all we need to do now is to join them up!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150108"
            ]
          },
          "705150108": {
            "id": "705150108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "No, no, not at all. My machine is not some hastily cobbled-together amalgam of scrap!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150109"
            ]
          },
          "705150109": {
            "id": "705150109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Every part is wonderfully, intricately meshed together like a... like a... Um...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150110"
            ]
          },
          "705150110": {
            "id": "705150110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Eh, never mind. I've never been the best at analogies. I swear Xavier stole all the talent in rhetoric for himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150111"
            ]
          },
          "705150111": {
            "id": "705150111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Either way, give it a go. It'll be interesting, I guarantee it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051502",
      "subQuestName": "Splice the Evermotion Mechanical Painting together",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705150201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705150201": {
            "id": "705150201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Perfect! Why, it's lovely! Skilled in both mind and hand, you are, and more so than I could have expected, too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150202"
            ]
          },
          "705150202": {
            "id": "705150202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Hah. I do recall that several ludicrous manuscripts from The Steambird described you as... as...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150205"
            ]
          },
          "705150205": {
            "id": "705150205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Heh... As a straight-shooting knight-errant who prefers to let their blade do the talking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150206"
            ]
          },
          "705150206": {
            "id": "705150206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Ah, how ridiculous and foolish those reporters were! How much ado they made about so little! After all, who are you, if not a sharp, smart, humble... and well, straight-shooting knight-errant?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150207"
            ]
          },
          "705150207": {
            "id": "705150207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "When I get the time, they shall hear from me. Oh yes, they will!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150208"
            ]
          },
          "705150208": {
            "id": "705150208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "Ah, right. Please take this particular device. You can take it out for a little leisure, should you, well, be at leisure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705150209"
            ]
          },
          "705150209": {
            "id": "705150209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Félix Yogue",
            "text": "As for me, I've got to start raising the Mora I'll need to travel to Liyue..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7051503",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Félix Yogue",
      "sceneId": null,
